{"record":"event","seq":115,"event":{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_013mNF6R3R3PJ81WJqyEdWjb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Why Good Logging Matters\n\nGood logging is essential for maintaining healthy, reliable software systems. When applications fail or behave unexpectedly, logs serve as the primary diagnostic tool for understanding what went wrong. Without clear, well-structured logs, developers are left guessing at root causes, turning simple debugging sessions into hours-long investigations. Effective logging provides a chronological record of system behavior that makes it possible to reconstruct events, identify patterns, and pinpoint issues quickly.\n\nBeyond troubleshooting, good logging practices support proactive system management and long-term maintainability. Logs enable teams to monitor application health, track performance metrics, and detect anomalies before they escalate into critical failures. They also provide valuable audit trails for security analysis and compliance requirements. When logs are consistent, appropriately detailed, and well-organized, they become a powerful asset for both immediate problem-solving and strategic decision-making.\n\n**Key benefits of good logging:**\n- **Faster incident resolution** — Clear logs reduce mean time to recovery by helping teams quickly identify and fix issues\n- **Improved observability** — Comprehensive logging provides visibility into system behavior across distributed architectures\n- **Better collaboration** — Standardized log formats enable team members to understand system events without needing deep context"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":588,"cache_read_input_tokens":15584,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":588,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d500263-6697-4f8d-a0e6-ac23c14c0529","uuid":"bb628dfc-6fa8-4d47-a35a-67aa7567e480"}}
